				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレから　ガッツを
おすそわけ　だぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
