		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なかなか
悪くないじゃない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T09:45:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
