		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_JUGGLING_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみも　これを　キャッチ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
