		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_POLICE_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これで　きげんを　なおしてよ
ねっ　ねっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これで　機嫌を　なおしてよ
ねっ　ねっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
