			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイ『あれっ？
まけちゃった……？▼
ソラ『あちゃー……　やっぱ　みるのと
やるのは　ちがうわね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイ『あれっ？
負けちゃった……？▼
ソラ『あちゃー……　やっぱ　見るのと
やるのは　違うわね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プロの　しあいを　みると
ふしぎと　じしんが　わいてくるのよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プロの　試合を　みると
不思議と　自信が　沸いてくるのよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わくわく！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わくわく！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしも　かれいに　うごきたい！
ちょっと　キミ　つきあいなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしも　華麗に　動きたい！
ちょっと　キミ　つきあいなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プロが　やると　かんたんそうに
みえるんだから　ふしぎよねぇ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プロが　やると　簡単そうに
見えるんだから　不思議よねぇ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_08_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どきどき！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どきどき！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あっ！▼
せんしゅが　こっち　みてる！
いいとこ　みせるため　しょうぶだぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あっ！▼
選手が　こっち　見てる！
いいとこ　みせるため　勝負だぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>タク『ぎゃー！
かっこわるい　ところ　みせちゃった▼
ヤス『フレー！　フレー！
オレの　ポケモン！　あれ……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>タク『ぎゃー！
かっこわるい　ところ　見せちゃった▼
ヤス『フレー！　フレー！
オレの　ポケモン！　あれ……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こっち　みてると　おもったけど
あいての　せんしゅ　みてたわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こっち　みてると　思ったけど
相手の　選手　みてたわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あの　せんしゅは　オレを　みてる？
いや　みてないかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あの　選手は　オレを　見てる？
いや　見てないかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレが　ポケモンしょうぶに　かったら
こっちの　チーム　おうえん　しろよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレが　ポケモン勝負に　勝ったら
こっちの　チーム　応援しろよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたから　おまえを　おうえんする！▼
フレー　フレー　おまえ！
がんばれ　がんばれ　おまえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けたから　おまえを　応援する！▼
フレー　フレー　おまえ！
がんばれ　がんばれ　おまえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_08_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うーん　こっちの　チームの
おうえんが　たりないな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うーん　こっちの　チームの
応援が　たりないな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あの　ひきしまった　にくたいに！
それを　サポートする　ポケモン！▼
この　すばらしさを　つたえるために
ポケモンしょうぶを　しましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あの　ひきしまった　肉体に！
それを　サポートする　ポケモン！▼
この　素晴らしさを　伝えるために
ポケモン勝負を　しましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>タク『バスケの　すばらしさ……
きみに　つたわったと　おもう▼
ヤス『ボールの　ように
まるくなるか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>タク『バスケの　素晴らしさ……
きみに　伝わったと　思う▼
ヤス『ボールの　ように
丸くなるか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>バスケで　だいじなのは
バツグンの　チームワーク！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>バスケで　大事なのは
バツグンの　チームワーク！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フン！　フン！▼
いちりゅうの　スポーツマンは
せなかで　かたるんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フン！　フン！▼
一流の　スポーツマンは
背中で　語るんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　せんしゅから
うばいあいに　なる▽
あの　ボールに　ぼくは　なりたい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いろんな　選手から
奪い合いに　なる▽
あの　ボールに　ぼくは　なりたい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボールから　せんしゅを　みると
ぼくの　ために　あらそわないで！▽
って　かんじに　みえるよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボールから　選手を　みると
ぼくの　ために　争わないで！▽
って　感じに　みえるよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_09_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　せんしゅから
うばいあいに　なる▽
あの　ボールに　ぼくは　なりたい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
