	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アメフト　ファンの　だんけつりょくは
どんな　スクラムにも　まさるぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アメフト　ファンの　団結力は
どんな　スクラムにも　勝るぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>タカ『きみたちの　だんけつりょくも
ガッチリしてる　じゃないの！▼
シゲ『この　おもいは　ゴールラインを
はるか　こえていく……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>タカ『君たちの　団結力も
ガッチリしてる　じゃないの！▼
シゲ『この　想いは　ゴールラインを
はるか　越えていく……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アメフトが　アツいのは　せんしゅ
みんなの　アツい　だんけつりょくが▽
しあいで　かんじられるからさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アメフトが　アツいのは　選手
みんなの　アツい　団結力が▽
試合で　感じられるからさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレたちの　だんけつりょくは
まだまだ　こんなもんじゃないぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレたちの　団結力は
まだまだ　こんなもんじゃないぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　せいえんは　ゴールラインを
こえて　どこまでも　ひびくんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしの　声援は　ゴールラインを
越えて　どこまでも　響くんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>のどを　からして　せいえんを
おくると　おいしいみずが▽
もっと　おいしく　かんじるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>のどを　枯らして　声援を送ると
おいしいみずが▽
もっと　美味しく　感じるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_05_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ！　もっと　こえを　あげて！
エールを　おくるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ！　もっと　声を　あげて！
エールを　送るんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたし　オフェンスが　メイン
ともだちは　ディフェンス　メイン▼
アメフトファンの　チームワークを
みせつけるわよー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたし　オフェンスが　メイン
ともだちは　ディフェンス　メイン▼
アメフトファンの　チームワークを
みせつけるわよー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カホ『あなたの　ポケモンの
チームワーク　ばつぐん！▼
マコ『はげしい　ぶつかりあいに
わたし　しっしん　しそう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カホ『あなたの　ポケモンの
チームワーク　ばつぐん！▼
マコ『激しい　ぶつかりあいに
わたし　失神しそう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おたがいの　やりたいことが
バラバラだと　ダブルバトルで▽
かつのは　むずかしいわねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おたがいの　やりたいことが
バラバラだと　ダブルバトルで▽
勝つのは　難しいわねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アメフトは　チームプレイ！
ポケモン　２ひきは　よういして！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アメフトは　チームプレイ！
ポケモン　２匹は　用意して！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダブルバトル！▼
アメフトの　あつさを
かんじるには　これしかないわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダブルバトル！▼
アメフトの　熱さを
感じるには　これしかないわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フォーメーションが
しょうぶの　ながれを　かえる……▽
ポケモンしょうぶも　おなじね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フォーメーションが
勝負の　流れを　変える……▽
ポケモン勝負も　同じね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_07_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダブルバトル！▼
アメフトの　あつさを　かんじるには
ポケモンが　２ひきは　ひつようよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダブルバトル！▼
アメフトの　熱さを　感じるには
ポケモンが　２匹は　必要よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ドンドンドン！　あ　ドンドンドン！
ファンの　こどうを　きいてくれい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ドンドンドン！　あ　ドンドンドン！
ファンの　鼓動を　きいてくれい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>タツ『われらの　たましいの　こどう！
ごせいちょう　ありがとうございます！▼
マサ『われらの　たましいの　さけび！
ごせいちょう　ありがとうございます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>タツ『我らファンの　魂の　鼓動！
ご清聴　ありがとうございます！▼
マサ『我らファンの　魂の　叫び！
ご清聴　ありがとうございます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あ　それっ　パン　パパン　ヒュー！！
つぎは　このリズムで　いきますかな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あ　それっ　パン　パパン　ヒュー！！
次は　このリズムで　いきますかな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
