				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>持て余した　ガッツを
またまた　おすそわけ　だぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
