			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SOCCER_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよい　ポケモン……　つまり
エースを　ちゅうしんに　した▽
チームも　よしあしが　あるもんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強い　ポケモン……　つまり
エースを　中心にした▽
チームも　良し悪しが　あるもんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASEBALL_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ワシと　ポケモンの　バッテリーは
せかいさいきょう　じゃけん！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ワシと　ポケモンの　バッテリーは
世界最強　じゃけん！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASEBALL_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんと！　ワシの　ごうそっきゅうを
キャッチする　にんげんが　おるとは！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>何と！　ワシの　剛速球を
キャッチする　人間が　いるとは！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASEBALL_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これも　キャッチせえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これも　キャッチせえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASEBALL_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ワシの　たまは　はやすぎてのお
うたれんのは　いいんじゃけど▼
ポケモンいがいには　なかなか
うけとめて　もらえんのじゃ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ワシの　球は　速すぎてのお
打たれんのは　いいんじゃけど▼
ポケモン以外には　なかなか
受け止めて　もらえんのじゃ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FOOTBALL_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
