		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER8_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_POKE_LAST"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まいったのう……　あとがないのに
ワクワクして　たまらんわい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>参ったのう……　あとがないのに
ワクワクして　たまらんわい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER8_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たいした　もんじゃ！
ええ　ポケモン　そだてとるな！▽
おはん　やりおる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たいした　もんじゃ！
ええ　ポケモン　育てとるな！▽
おはん　やりおる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T12:15:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWRIVAL_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_FIRST_DAMAGE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いまの　あいぼうの　いたみ！
ぜったいに　わすれないぜッ！</Text>
