		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今の　相棒の　痛み！
絶対に　忘れないぜッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:02" />
