				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>相手の　めを　みたら
戦いたい　気持ち　わかるよな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
