		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おまえの　勝ちたい　気持ち
すごく　伝わってきたぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
