	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MINI_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……まけても　かわいいもん
あたしの　チョロネコ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
