	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MINI_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>１ぴき　２ひきで　かてないなら
なかまを　ふやしてあげようかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>１匹　２匹で　勝てないなら
仲間を　増やしてあげようかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
