		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ギターを　ひいているとき
ポケモンを　たいけつ　させるとき▽
あたし　まっすぐで　いられるの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ギターを　弾いているとき
ポケモンを　対決させるとき▽
あたし　まっすぐで　いられるの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もー！　ごきげんな　じかんは
すぐ　おわっちゃうんだから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もー！　ごきげんな　時間は
すぐ　終わっちゃうんだから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T04:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　いっしょに　いるから
ごきげんに　ギターを　かなでられるし▼
ギターを　ひくから　ポケモンも
つよくなるのよ！　わかる？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　一緒に　いるから
ごきげんに　ギターを　奏でられるし▼
ギターを　弾くから　ポケモンも
強くなるのよ！　わかる？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これが……
げんじつ　って　やつ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これが……
現実って　やつ？</Text>
