		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フットボールを　みたあとは
じぶんたちも　あばれたーい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T04:09:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T04:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フットボール観戦後は
自分たちも　暴れたーい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T04:09:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T04:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ナナ『すがすがしい　までに
かんぱい　だわ……▼
アヤ『いっしょうけんめい
おうえん　したんだけどなあ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ナナ『清清しい　までに
完敗だわ……▼
アヤ『一生懸命
応援したんだけどなあ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かった　まけたも　だいじだけど
それしか　みえなくなるは　ダメ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝った　負けたも　大事だけど
それしか　みえなくなるのは　ダメ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_11_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかえる　ポケモンが　１ひきじゃ
チームプレイが　できないね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦える　ポケモンが　１匹じゃ
チームプレイが　できないね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
