				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ドッカーン！！▼
いろんな　色が　混じりあい
新しい　色を　生みだすのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T06:20:10" />
