			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボクの　ポケモンたち
ミュージカルが　お気に入り！▽
ダンスの　達人なんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
