	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MUSICIAN_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんでもさ　まずはさ
やってみるのが　ベスト！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
