	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MUSICIAN_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみは　つよい　トレーナー！
ぼくは　うまい　ギタリスト！▽
どっちも　すごいって　ことだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみは　強い　トレーナー！
ぼくは　上手い　ギタリスト！▽
どっちも　すごいって　ことだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
