		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あめは　ステキ♪
ないていても　かさで　かくせる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>雨は　ステキ♪
泣いていても　傘で　隠せる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
