				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あらら……
負けちゃった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
