			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとは　こきゅうを　するだけで
すいぶんを　うしなう！▼
つまり　いきることは
あせを　かくことだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人は　呼吸を　するだけで
水分を　失う！▼
つまり　生きることは
汗を　かくことだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヘイ！　トレーナー！▼
オレさまの　ロングシュートの
ひきょりに　おどろきな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヘイ！　トレーナー！▼
オレさまの　ロングシュートの
飛距離に　驚きな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ロングシュートじゃ　まけないが
ポケモンしょうぶは　まだまだだぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ロングシュートじゃ　負けないが
ポケモン勝負は　まだまだだぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみに　どうぐを　ショートパス！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみに　道具を　ショートパス！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>バスケの　テクニックと
ポケモンしょうぶの　テクニック！▼
どっちも　おくが　ふかいぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>バスケの　テクニックと
ポケモン勝負の　テクニック！▼
どっちも　奥が　深いぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヨー！　ブラザー！▼
どうだい　このボール！
ピッカピカに　みがいたんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヨー！　ブラザー！▼
どうだい　このボール！
ピッカピカに　磨いたんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょうぶには　まけたが　ボールの
かがやきでは　まけてないぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝負には　負けたが　ボールの
輝きでは　負けてないぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　どうぐも
ピカピカに　みがいたんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この道具も
ピカピカに　磨いたんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BASKET_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つかう　ボールを
だいじに　あつかうってのは▽
スポーツも　ポケモンも　おなじだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>使う　ボールを
大事に　扱うってのは▽
スポーツも　ポケモンも　同じだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>れんしゅうじあいが　ちかいのよ！▼
あんたを　かべに　みたてて
スマッシュの　れんしゅうさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>練習試合が　近いのよ！▼
あんたを　壁に　みたてて
スマッシュの　練習さ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハアッ！　ハア　ハア　ハア……
いい　トレーニングに　なったわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハアッ！　ハア　ハア　ハア……
いい　トレーニングになったわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハア　ハア　ハア
ハア　ハア　ハア……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハア　ハア　ハア
ハア　ハア　ハア……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたと　ワタシは　であったばかり
ラブゲームからの　スタートね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたと　ワタシは　であったばかり
ラブゲームからの　スタートね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ラリーで　きたえた
この　きゃくりょく！▽
みて　おどろきなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ラリーで　鍛えた　この脚力！
みて　驚きなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶは
また　べつの　はなしね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負は
また　別の　話ね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうぐの　プレゼントよ！
みて　おどろきなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>道具の　プレゼントよ！
みて　驚きなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すばやい　ポケモンと
トレーニング　すると▽
しぜんと　きゃくりょくが　つくの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すばやい　ポケモンと
トレーニング　すると▽
自然と　脚力が　つくの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たりゅうじあいが　ちかいのよ！▼
あんたを　かべに　みたてて
スマッシュの　れんしゅうよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>他流試合が　近いのよ！▼
あんたを　壁に　みたてて
スマッシュの　練習よ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハアッ！　ハア　ハア　ハア……
いい　トレーニングになったわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハアッ！　ハア　ハア　ハア……
いい　トレーニングに　なったわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハア　ハア　ハア
ハア　ハア　ハア……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハア　ハア　ハア
ハア　ハア　ハア……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたと　ワタシは　であったばかり
ラブゲームからの　スタートね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたと　ワタシは　出会ったばかり
ラブゲームからの　スタートね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　ラフボールも　みぬく
この　どうたいしりょく！▽
なにごとも　みのがさないわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　ラフボールも　見抜く
この　動体視力！▽
なにごとも　見逃さないわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　つよさ
めに　やきつけたわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　強さ
目に　焼きつけたわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　プレゼントも
めに　やきつけてね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　プレゼントも
目に　焼きつけてね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うちかえさずに　スルーしたほうが
いいときも　あるの▼
とっさの　はんだんりょくも
テニスには　ひつよう　なのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>打ち返さずに　スルーしたほうが
いいときも　あるの▼
とっさの　判断力も
テニスには　必要なのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いとを　はりに　とおすような
ピンポイント　スマッシュ▽
うけてみなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>糸を　針に　通すような
ピンポイント　スマッシュ▽
受けてみなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　こうげきにも　たいおうする
なんという　ふところの　ふかさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　攻撃にも　対応する
なんという　懐の　深さ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしも　どうぐの　プレゼントで
ふところの　ふかさ　みせちゃうわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしも　道具の　プレゼントで
懐の　深さ　みせちゃうわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TENNIS_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いっきゅう　いっきゅうに
ぜんしん　ぜんれいを　こめる！▼
じんせいは　いつも　マッチポイント！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一球　一球に
全身全霊を　こめる！▼
人生は　いつも　マッチポイント！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンブリーダーとしての
しゅぎょうのため　あいてを！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンブリーダーとしての
修行のため　相手を！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……まだまだ　でした
もっと　そだてます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……まだまだ　でした
もっと　育てます！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ありがとう　ございます！▼
すごく　べんきょうに　なりました
また　おあいて　してください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ありがとう　ございます！▼
すごく　勉強に　なりました
また　お相手　してください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:47:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いつも　このあたりを
パトロールしている　この　オレ！▼
ちけいを　いかした
ポケモンしょうぶを　おみせする！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いつも　この辺りを
パトロールしている　この　オレ！▼
地形を　活かした
ポケモン勝負を　おみせする！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T09:05:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T09:05:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちけいを　いかしきれなかった……
なんたることだ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>地形を　活かしきれなかった……
なんたることだ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T09:05:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T09:05:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンジャーが　つねに　もっている
これを　きみに……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンジャーが　常に　持っている
これを　きみに……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もりも　そこに　くらす
ポケモンも　いきている……▼
まいにち　なにかしら　へんかして
パトロールも　たのしいんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>森も　そこに　暮らす
ポケモンも　生きている……▼
毎日　なにかしら　変化して
パトロールも　楽しいんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いきは　ピッタリ！▼
おどろきの　コンビネーションで
レンジャーのこと　おしえてあげる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>息は　ピッタリ！▼
驚きの　コンビネーションで
レンジャーのこと　教えてあげる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたたちの　こと
おそわっちゃったわね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたたちの　こと
教わっちゃったわね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　きのみは
しっている？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　きのみは
知っている？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたも　みみを　すませて……！▼
ポケモンや　くさきの
こきゅうする　おとが　きこえるかも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたも　耳を　澄ませて……！▼
ポケモンや　草木の
息吹が　きこえるかも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モンスターボールを　１００こも
なげて　つかまえた　ママンボウだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モンスターボールを　１００こも
投げて　捕まえた　ママンボウだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なげた　ボールの　かずは……
しょうぶに　かんけい　なかったか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>投げた　ボールの　数は……
勝負に　関係なかったか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほかにも　ママンボウは　いるけど
こいつに　うんめい　かんじちゃってね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>他にも　ママンボウは　いるけど
こいつに　運命　感じちゃってね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あーっ！　ばらしてしまった！
あと　ちょっとで　つれたのに！▽
こういうときは　ポケモンしょうぶ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あーっ！　ばらしてしまった！
あと　ちょっとで　釣れたのに！▽
こういうときは　ポケモン勝負！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>くーっ！　まけたが
いい　きぶん　てんかんに　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>くーっ！　負けたが
いい　気分転換に　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えものを　にがした　くらいで
さわいでいる　ようじゃあ▽
いい　つりびとには　なれないよ▽
つねに　まえむき　でないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>獲物を　逃がした　くらいで
騒いでいる　ようじゃあ▽
いい　つりびとには　なれないよ▽
常に　前向きで　ないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おれは　すべてを　あいする
すばらしい　つりびと！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おれは　すべてを　愛する
すばらしい　つりびと！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ざんねんな　けっか　すらも
おれは　あいしてやる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>残念な　結果すらも
おれは　愛してやる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒウンシティから　でる
ロイヤルイッシュごう　で▽
うみづりを　してみたいぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒウンシティから　出航する
ロイヤルイッシュ号で▽
海釣りを　してみたいぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_19_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おまえさん！　どんな　すごい
ポケモンを　つれているんだい！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おまえさん！　どんな　すごい
ポケモンを　連れているんだい！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_19_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほほー！
こりゃ　たいした　ポケモンだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほほー！
こりゃ　たいした　ポケモンだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_19_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんの　ポケモンが
じぶんにとって　いちばん　ですからね▽
たにんと　くらべたり　しないですよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:01:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:01:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分の　ポケモンが
自分にとって　一番　ですからね！▽
他人と　比べたり　しないですよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:01:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T12:01:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>パラソル　かたてに　ビーチで
ひとり　たたずむ　おんな……▽
ねえ　あなた　あいてしてよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>パラソル片手に　ビーチで
１人　たたずむ　女……▽
ねえ　あなた　相手してよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しがいせんを　カットできても
わざは　カットできないのね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>紫外線を　カットできても
技は　カットできないのね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ビーチに　パラソルは
ひつようって　きいたんだけど……▽
もってるのは　アタシだけ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ビーチに　パラソルは
必要って　きいたんだけど……▽
持ってるのは　アタシだけ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_14_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかえる　ポケモンを
３ひきいじょう　つれていたら▽
レッツ　ローテーションだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦える　ポケモンを
３匹以上　連れていたら▽
レッツ　ローテーションだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いきの　あった　３ひきの
れんけいが　かなめ！▽
レッツ　ローテーションっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>息の　あった
３匹の　連携が　要！▽
レッツ　ローテーションっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベストな　ポケモン
ベストな　ポジションを　あやまった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベストな　ポケモン
ベストな　ポジションを　誤った！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ナイスな　チームワークに
けいいを　ひょうして▽
この　きのみを　あげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ナイスな　チームワークに
敬意を　表して▽
この　きのみを　あげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルなら
いつも　いじょうの　よみが　いる！▽
トレーナーの　うでが　ためされるね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルなら
いつも以上の　読みが　いる！▽
トレーナーの　腕が　試されるね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_14_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかえる　ポケモンを
３ひきいじょう　つれていたら▽
レッツ　トリプルバトルよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦える　ポケモンを
３匹以上　連れていたら▽
レッツ　トリプルバトルよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>３ひきの　ちからを　あわせて
レッツ　トリプルバトルっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>３匹の　力を　あわせて
レッツ　トリプルバトルっ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みんなは　ひとりの　ためにね！
いけてる　チームプレーだったわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みんなは　ひとりの　ためにね！
いけてる　チームプレーだったわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>グレイトな　チームワークに
かんどうしたから　これを　あげるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>グレイトな　チームワークに
感動したから　これを　あげるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トリプルバトルなら　ポケモンの
ちからは　いつもの　３ばいいじょう！▽
トレーナーの　うでが　ためされるわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トリプルバトルなら　ポケモンの
力は　いつもの　３倍以上！▽
トレーナーの　腕が　試されるわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エリートに　ふさわしい
きたえぬかれた　にくたい　で！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エリートに　ふさわしい
鍛え抜かれた　肉体で！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくの　にくたいに
ポケモンが　ついてこれなかったか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくの　肉体に
ポケモンが　ついてこれなかったか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けんこう　というか
げんき　なら　ムチャできるからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>健康というか
元気なら　ムチャできるからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はしの　うえでの　たちあい……▼
エリートである　わたしに
ピッタリの　シチュエーション！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>橋の　上での　立会い……▼
エリートである　わたしに
ピッタリの　シチュエーション！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たかい　ところ……
ほんとうは　にがて　なのよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>高い　ところ……
本当は　苦手なのよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にがてなものを　こくふくしてこそ
エリートな　トレーナー！▼
……でも　やっぱり
たかい　ところは　こわいわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>苦手なものを　克服してこそ
エリートな　トレーナー！▼
……でも　やっぱり
高い　ところは　怖いわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チカと　あたしは　いっしんどうたい！▼
だから　あなたにも　２ひきの
ポケモンを　だしてもらうわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チカと　あたしは　一心同体！▼
だから　あなたにも　２匹の
ポケモンを　だしてもらうわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エリ『まあ　おどろいた！
チカ『まあ　おどろいた！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エリ『まあ　驚いた！
チカ『まあ　驚いた！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もっと　つよくなって　チカを
まもれるように　ならなきゃ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もっと　強くなって　チカを
守れるように　ならなきゃ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかえる　ポケモン　１ひきだけ？
あたしたち　ふたりだから……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦える　ポケモン　１匹だけ？
あたしたち　２人だから……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エリと　いっしょに　たたかうのって
とっても　たのしいんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エリと　一緒に　戦うのって
とっても　楽しいんだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なかよしの　ともだちと
ちからを　あわせて　しょうぶって▽
すごく　ステキな　ことだよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>仲良しの　友達と
力を　合わせて　勝負って▽
すごく　ステキな　ことだよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FANW_12_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなた　たたかえる　ポケモンが
１ひきしか　いないの？▼
２ｖｓ２の　ポケモンしょうぶ
とっても　たのしいのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなた　戦える　ポケモンが
１匹しか　いないの？▼
２ｖｓ２の　ポケモン勝負
とっても　楽しいのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>デコボコみちで　おのれを　みがく！
こんじょうを　きたえるのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>デコボコ道で　己を　磨く！
根性を　鍛えるのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こんじょうだけでは　かてない！
それもまた　じじつ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>根性だけでは　勝てない！
それもまた　事実……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンが　いてくれるから
おたがい　かこくな　トレーニングに
たえて　たえて　たえられる！▼
こんじょうが　つなげる
つよい　むすびつきが　あるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンが　いてくれるから
お互い　過酷な　トレーニングに
堪えて　堪えて　堪えられる！▼
根性が　つなげる
強い　結びつきが　あるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スタミナーッ！▼
いのちの　ほのおを　もやし！
どこまでも　ノンストップ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T05:27:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T05:27:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スタミナーッ！▼
命の　炎を　燃やし！
どこまでも　ノンストップ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T05:27:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T05:27:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スタミナぎれー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スタミナ切れー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_14_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ノンストップ　なんて　ウソウソ！▼
ときには　たちどまって
こころと　からだを　やすめないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ノンストップ　なんて　ウソウソ！▼
ときには　たちどまって
心と　体を　休めないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみに　おねがいが　あります！
そう　しょうぶ　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみに　お願いが　あります！
そう　勝負です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけて　くやしいのと
ポケモンが　そだって　うれしいのと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けて　悔しいのと
ポケモンが　育って　うれしいのと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみとの　しょうぶは
とても　いい　けいけんに　なります▽
また　あいてを　おねがいします！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみとの　勝負は
とても　いい　経験に　なります▽
また　相手を　お願いします！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERW_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいじょう　こめて　そだてた
じまんの　ポケモンたちよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛情　こめて　育てた
自慢の　ポケモンたちよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERW_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいじょうで　まけた……
ううん！　あなたが　すごいのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛情で　負けた……
ううん！　あなたが　すごいのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERW_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいじょう　こめて　そだてないと
いやいや　たたかうような▽
かわいそうな　ポケモンに　なるもの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛情　こめて　育てないと
いやいや　戦うような▽
かわいそうな　ポケモンに　なるもの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おなじ　じかんを　すごし
こころが　つうじあわせた▽
あたしたちに　かてるかしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>同じ　時間を　過ごし
心が　通じ合わせた▽
あたしたちに　勝てるかしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたたちも　しっかり
こころが　つうじているのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたたちも　しっかり
心が　通じ合っているのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　きのみを　みたら
あたしたちを　おもいだしてね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　きのみを　みたら
あたしたちを　思い出してね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンジャーの　しごとが　たのしいのは
ポケモンと　ともに　すごせるからよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンジャーの　仕事が　楽しいのは
ポケモンと　共に　過ごせるからよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たきに　うたれて
せいしんを　きたえなおした！▽
なにがあっても　どうじないぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>滝に　打たれて
精神を　鍛えなおした！▽
なにがあっても　動じないぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうじて……
いや　どうして……だ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>動じて……
いや　どうして……だ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみの　つよさを　みとめ
こいつを　プレゼントしよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみの　強さを　認め
こいつを　プレゼントしよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たきに　うたれて
せいしんを　きたえなおすか！▼
ついでに　からだも　あらおう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>滝に　打たれて
精神を　鍛えなおすか！▼
ついでに　体も　洗おう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せかいを　たびする　りゆうは
きけんを　もとめているから！▽
きみは　きけんな　トレーナーかい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>世界を　旅する　理由は
危険を　求めているから！▽
きみは　危険な　トレーナーかい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きけんな　ヤツ……
この　しょうぶ　きけん　したかった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>危険な　ヤツ……
この勝負　棄権したかった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なぜ　きけんを　もとめるか？▼
だって　ゾクゾクすると
いきている　じっかんが　わくからね！　</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なぜ　危険を　求めるか？▼
だって　ゾクゾクすると
生きている　実感が　わくからね！　</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まよったまま
あなたと　しょうぶ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>迷ったまま
あなたと　勝負！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まよったままじゃ
かてっこ　ないのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>迷ったままじゃ
勝てっこ　ないのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここが　どんな　ばしょだか
いまいち　わかってないんだ！▼
だって　あたし
マップとか　みない　ひとだし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここが　どんな　場所だか
いまいち　わかってないんだ！▼
だって　あたし
マップとか　みない　人だし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレらの　チームに　はいれ！▼
というか　ムリヤリ　いれてやる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレらの　チームに　はいれ！▼
というか　ムリヤリ　いれてやる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよすぎる　ヤツは　いらん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強すぎる　ヤツは　いらん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まいにち　エブリデイ
ここで　ダラダラ　してんだよ！▽
せかいが　おわるまでな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>毎日　エブリディ
ここで　ダラダラ　するんだぜ！▽
世界が　終わるまでな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレが　かったら
オマエの　ポケモンを　くれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレが　勝ったら
オマエの　ポケモンを　くれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジョーダンなのに
みんな　ムキに　なりやがって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジョーダンなのに
みんな　ムキに　なりやがって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハン！　よわい　ポケモンを
てしおに　かけて　そだてて▽
つよくするのが　オレの　しゅぎ　だぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハン！　弱い　ポケモンを
手塩に　かけて　育てて▽
強くするのが　オレの　主義だぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここを　とおるってのか？▼
だったら　オレに　あいさつしろよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここを　通るってのか？▼
だったら　オレに　あいさつしろよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>コイツめ！
なんて　うでっぷし　だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>コイツめ！
なんて　腕っぷし　だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たいようを　おいかけて　はしり
よるに　なると　ねむる……▽
そんな　せいかつも　いいかもな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>太陽を　追いかけて　走り
夜になると　眠る……▽
そんな　生活も　いいかもな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ニヤニヤ！　オレさま
スピードと　ワイルドさ　じゃ▽
だれにも　まけねーぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ニヤニヤ！　オレさま
スピードと　ワイルドさ　じゃ▽
だれにも　負けねーぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけちゃってるじゃん！
ダサいじゃん　オレさま！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けちゃってるじゃん！
ダサいじゃん　オレさま！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あーあ！　いっそのこと
バイクを　かついで　はしろうか！▽
そうすりゃ　ワイルドだろ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あーあ！　いっそのこと
バイクを　かついで　走ろうか！▽
そうすりゃ　ワイルドだろ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヘイヘイ！　ヒューヒュー！▼
いい　ポケモン　もってんじゃねーか
ちょっと　オレに　みせてみろよー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヘイヘイ！　ヒューヒュー！▼
いい　ポケモン　持ってんじゃねーか
ちょっと　オレに　みせてみろよー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジム『そっ　それがあ！
おまえたちの　ゆうじょう　なのか！▼
サブ『なんだとお！？　ワルの
ゆうじょうが　つうじなかった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジム『そっ　それがあ！
おまえたちの　友情なのか！▼
サブ『なんだとお！？　ワルの
友情が　通じなかった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いい　ポケモンは　いるが！
ワルい　ポケモンは　いねえ！▼
ぜーんぶ　トレーナー　しだい　だろ
オレは　そう　おもうぜえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いい　ポケモンは　いるが！
ワルい　ポケモンは　いねえ！▼
ぜーんぶ　トレーナー次第　だろ
オレは　そう　思うぜえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモン　いっぴきだと？
そんな　しょうぶ　ツマラナイだろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン　１匹だと？
そんな　勝負　ツマラナイだろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おらおら！▼
ワルと　ワルが　がったい！
どういうことか　わかるか？▼
すごく　ワルって　ことだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おらおら！▼
ワルと　ワルが　合体！
どういうことか　わかるか？▼
すごく　ワルって　ことだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ワルい　おれらにも
ゆうじょうが　あるんだよ！▼
いいよな……
おとこと　おとこの　ゆうじょう▽
ポケモンとの　ゆうじょう……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ワルい　おれらにも
友情が　あるんだよ！▼
いいよな……
男と　男の　友情▽
ポケモンとの　友情……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADTEAM_03_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんだとー　たたかえる
ポケモンが　いっぴき　だと？▼
２ｖｓ１で　たたかうような
ひきょーな　まねが　できるかよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんだとー　戦える
ポケモンが　１匹だと？▼
２ｖｓ１で　戦うような
ひきょーな　真似が　できるかよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　また　おいらたちの
あせと　なみだが　ジムに　しみこむ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　また　おいらたちの
汗と　涙が　ジムに　染みこむ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いままで　いくつもの　かべを
ぶちこわして　きた　オレらなのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いままで　いくつもの　壁を
ぶち壊して　きた　オレらなのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かてそうと　かてるは
とおくて　ちかいよな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝てそうと　勝てるは
遠くて　近いよな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけて　めのまえ　まっくら！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けて　目の前　真っ暗！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベルトコンベアが　つよい
オマエを　はこんできやがった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベルトコンベアが　強い
オマエを　運んできやがった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_29_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたが　おれは
ポケモンたちを　しんじつづけるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けたが　おれは
ポケモンたちを　信じ続けるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_30_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレの　あしもとの　おとしあな……
きづかずに　たたかっていたか！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレの　足元の　落とし穴……
気づかずに　戦っていたか！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかい　トレーナーよ！▼
まよっていることが　あるのなら
わたしが　むねを　かしてあげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>若い　トレーナーよ！▼
迷っていることが　あるのなら
わたしが　胸を　貸してあげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よくやった！
たたかいかたに　まよいがない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よくやった！
戦い方に　迷いがない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はずかしながら　わたしは
みちに　まよっているんだ……▼
どこから　きたんだったかなぁ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>恥ずかしながら　わたしは
道に　迷っているんだ……▼
どこから　来たんだったかなぁ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダイビングの　わざが　あれば
もぐったり　しずんだり　できるのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダイビングの　技が　あれば
潜ったり　沈んだり　できるのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぶくぶく
……しずみゆく　オレ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぶくぶく
……沈みゆく　オレ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おまえの　ポケモン
ダイビングの　わざは　おぼえたか？▼
ダイビングは　いいぞお！　すごいぞお！
なんたって　ダイビング　だからな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おまえの　ポケモン
ダイビングの　技は　覚えたか？▼
ダイビングは　いいぞお！　すごいぞお！
なんたって　ダイビング　だからな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せかいかっこくの　ポケモンジムに
ちょうせん　してたんですよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>世界各国の　ポケモンジムに
挑戦してたんですよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けっかは　だせなかったが
ジムで　まなんで　つよくなましたよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>結果は　だせなかったが
ジムで　学んで　強くなましたよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいんだよ！　じぶんのは
たのしむための　ポケモンしょうぶ▼
かちまくりたい　ひとは
なっとく　するまで　がんばりなさいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいんですよ！　自分のは
楽しむための　ポケモン勝負▼
勝ちまくりたい　人は
納得するまで　がんばりなさいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>およぎながら　いきている　オレたち！
もちろん　しょうぶも　およぎながら！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>泳ぎながら　生きている　オレたち！
もちろん　勝負も　泳ぎながら！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……まけたが　およぎながら
たたかった　オレ　すごい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……負けたが　泳ぎながら
戦った　オレ　すごい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレと　ポケモンは　みた！▼
サザナミの　かいていに　しずんでいる
おおむかしの　いせきを！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレと　ポケモンは　みた！▼
サザナミの　海底に　沈んでいる
大昔の　遺跡を！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　ポケモンが
わざを　くりだす　ようすは▽
まさに　アバンチュール！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　ポケモンが
技を　繰りだす　様子は▽
まさに　アバンチュール！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……アバンチュールは
もう　おわったのね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……アバンチュールは
もう　終わったのね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしの　バカンスに　おわりはないの
……いいのかしら　これで？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしの　バカンスに　終わるはないの
……いいのかしら　これで？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サザナミから　ひろがる　うみで
しょうぶを　くりひろげるのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サザナミから　広がる　海で
勝負を　繰り広げるのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>このまま　ぷかぷか
ながされていくのよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>このまま　ぷかぷか
流されていくのよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ときどき　クラゲの　ポケモンが
ぷかぷか　うかんでいるのよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ときどき　クラゲの　ポケモンが
ぷかぷか　浮かんでいるのよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いとしの　ポケモンたちに
うみを　みせているの……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛しいの　ポケモンたちに
海を　みせているの……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わお！
モーレツ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わお！
モーレツ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　けしきを　みたいな▼
せかいの　ひろさ
じぶんの　ちいささを　しってこそ▽
あしたに　きぼうが　もてるもの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いろんな　景色を　みたいな▼
世界の　広さ
自分の　小ささを　知ってこそ▽
明日に　希望が　もてるもの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　でっけえ　みずたまり！
うみ　っていうんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　でっけえ　水たまり！
海って　いうんだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おまえ！
でっけえな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おまえ！
でっけえな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおきいことは　いいことだ！
なぜなら　おおきいからだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大きいことは　いいことだ！
なぜなら　大きいからだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>セイガイハの　ジムリーダー！
シズイさんに　きたえられた　オレだぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>セイガイハの　ジムリーダー！
シズイさんに　鍛えられた　オレだぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは　まだ　しゅうれんを　つめる！
ありがとう！　おしえてくれて！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは　まだ　修練を　積める！
ありがとう！　教えてくれて！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERM_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>セイガイハの　ジムリーダー
シズイさんは　なのかななばん▽
うみの　なかで　すごせるってよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>セイガイハの　ジムリーダー
シズイさんは　七日七晩▽
海の中で　過ごせるってよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>え！？　あなた　トレーナーなの
わーい！　テッポウオたち　カモーン！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>え！？　あなた　トレーナーなの
わーい！　テッポウオたち　カモーン！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ……！　テッポウオたち
ボールに　もどる　じかんよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ……！　テッポウオたち
ボールに　戻る　時間よ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひつような　とき　いがいは
ボールの　なかで　まっているだけ……▼
ポケモンって　ひとにとって
つごうの　いい　そんざい　よね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>必要な　とき　以外は
ボールの　なかで　待っているだけ……▼
ポケモンって　人にとって
都合の　いい　存在よね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みて！　わたしの　ポケモン
すっごく　おおきいんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みて！　私の　ポケモン
すっごく　大きいんだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-05T03:01:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモン
みため　いじょうに　おおものね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモン
見た目　以上に　大物ね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWIMMERW_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>１４．５ｍもある　ホエルオーも
モンスターボールに　はいっちゃうんだ▽
かがくの　ちからって……　すごい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T11:04:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T11:04:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>１４．５ｍもある　ホエルオーも
モンスターボールに　はいっちゃうんだ▽
科学の　力って……　すごい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T11:04:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T11:04:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つりたて　ホヤホヤ　ピチピチの
ポケモンで　しょうぶだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>釣りたて　ホヤホヤ　ピチピチの
ポケモンで　勝負だ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つりたて　だから
どう　たたかうか　わかってないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>釣りたて　だから
どう　戦うか　わかってないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いまは　つりたて　ホヤホヤでも
ちゃんと　そだてれば　つよくなる！▼
おじさんと　ポケモンの
せいしゅんが　はじまるんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今は　釣りたて　ホヤホヤでも
ちゃんと　育てれば　強くなる！▼
おじさんと　ポケモンの
青春が　はじまるんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ソヤッ！　ソヤッ！▼
うみに　むかって　せいけんづき！
さあ　きみも　やってみよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ソヤッ！　ソヤッ！▼
海に向かって　せいけん突き！
さあ　きみも　やってみよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ソヤッ！　ソヤッ！
まけても　せいけんづきは　やめない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ソヤッ！　ソヤッ！
負けても　せいけん突きは　やめない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T12:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ビキニのおねえさんに
まどわされないよう　しゅぎょう！▼
ビキニのおねえさんを
みている　わけでは　ないッス！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ビキニのおねえさんに
惑わされないよう　修行！▼
ビキニのおねえさんを
みている　わけでは　ないッス！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DOCTOR_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみでは　そうぞういじょうに
たいりょくを　つかうけれど▽
きみの　ポケモン　だいじょうぶかい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>海では　想像以上に
体力を　消費するけれど▽
きみの　ポケモン　大丈夫かい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DOCTOR_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なるほど……！
げんきが　みなぎっているね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なるほど……！
元気が　みなぎっているね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DOCTOR_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_RECOVER_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>では　ポケモンに
げんき　ちゅうにゅう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>では　ポケモンに
元気注入！　スーパー回復！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DOCTOR_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_RECOVER_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これで　だいじょうぶ！
いつでも　まってるからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これで　大丈夫！
いつでも　待ってるからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BAKER_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！
しょうぶの　ごよやく　でしたね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！
勝負の　ご予約でしたね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BAKER_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あらまあ
しょうりまで　よやく　なさってたの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あらまあ
勝利まで　予約なさってたの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BAKER_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなた　すっごいわね！
ぜひ　うちで　やといたいくらい……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなた　すっごいわね！
ぜひ　うちで　雇いたいくらい……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひたすら　はしって
くさむら　ひとりじめ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひたすら　走って
草むら　独り占め！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかってたさ……
ひとりじめは　いけないって</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わかってたさ……
独り占めは　いけないって</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T07:04:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はしりまわっていたら
ヘビーウォーカー　っていう▽
メダル　もらっちゃったよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>走りまわっていたら
ヘビーウォーカー　っていう▽
メダル　もらっちゃったよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ARTIST_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハイレベルな　こうぼうは
まさに　げいじゅつ　です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハイレベルな　攻防は
まさに　芸術です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ARTIST_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そなたたちの　つよさは
ことばに　あらわせない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そなたたちの　強さは
言葉に　表せない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ARTIST_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かきたいように　かく！
いきたいように　いきる！▽
それが　いちばん　さ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>描きたいように　描く！
生きたいように　生きる！▽
それが　一番さ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　じぶんたちに
できることを　するだけです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　自分たちに
できることを　するだけです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>できることと　できないことが
わかったような　きがします</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>できることと　できないことが
わかったような　気がします</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BREEDERM_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>また　できることを　ふやして
あなたに　いどみたいです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>また　できることを　増やして
あなたに　挑みたいです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だまって　しょうぶ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>黙って　勝負！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
