		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_01_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは……　こいする　おとこ
そのなも　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは……　恋する　男
その名も　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひがな　いちにち　つりをしていると
いろんなことが　わかってくるんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひがな　一日　つりをしていると
いろんなことが　わかってくるんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どのような　けっかに　なっても
ポケモンは　そばに　いてくれる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どのような　結果に　なっても
ポケモンは　そばに　いてくれる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよければ　ひとから　ポケモンから
そんけい　されたりも　するが▽
そんなもの　まやかしだよ▼
まけたら　チヤホヤしていた　ひとは
あっさり　きえていくからね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>強ければ　人から　ポケモンから
尊敬されたりも　するが▽
そんなもの　まやかしだよ▼
まけたら　チヤホヤしていた　人は
あっさり　消えていくからね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうだい　はっぱの　のりごこちは？▼
もし　ボクに　かつことが　できれば
ちょっと　いいこと　おしえてやるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どうだい　葉っぱの　乗り心地は？▼
もし　ボクに　勝つことが　できれば
ちょっと　いいこと　教えてやるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけてしまうとは……！　はっぱに
のって　どこかに　ながされたいぜ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けてしまうとは……！　葉っぱに
乗って　どこかに　流されたいぜ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はっぱ　どうしが　ぶつかると
うごいていた　はっぱは　とまり▽
ぶつけられた　はっぱが　うごきだすぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>葉っぱ　同士が　ぶつかると
動いていた　葉っぱは　停止し▽
ぶつけられた　葉っぱが　動きだすぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ウォーターのような　とうめいかん……
それが　わたしの　めざす　スタイル！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ウォーターのような　透明感……
それが　私の　目指す　スタイル！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけた　わたしの
そんざいかんが　すきとおっている……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けた　私の
存在感が　透き通っている……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけた　わたし　だが
えらそうに　いおう！▼
めざす　スタイルは　あっていい
だが　スタイルは　ひとつ　じゃない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けた　私だが
偉そうに　いおう！▼
目指す　スタイルは　あっていい
だが　スタイルは　ひとつ　じゃない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっ！　わざわざ
あいてを　してくれるとは！▼
うれしいね！　おれいに
ぜんりょくで　たたきつぶすよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっ！　わざわざ
相手を　してくれるとは！▼
うれしいね！　お礼に
全力で　たたきつぶすよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あっとうてき　だな……
なんて　トレーナー　だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>圧倒的　だな……
なんて　トレーナー　だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたことで　オレは　つよくなる！▼
この　くやしさを　バネに
ふたたび　はいあがる　からな！▽
そういう　いみで　おれいを　いうぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けたことで　オレは　つよくなる！▼
この　悔しさを　バネに
再び　はいあがる　からな！▽
そういう意味で　お礼を　いうぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みずは　ながれている　かぎり
くさらないと　いう……▽
わたしも　たたかいつづければ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>水は　流れている　かぎり
くさらないと　いう……▽
わたしも　戦い続ければ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけても　あきらめない……！
その　タフさが　エリートの　プライド</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けても　あきらめない……！
その　タフさが　エリートの　プライド</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ながれる　はっぱ　はね
のるときの　むきに　よって▽
ゆきさきが　かわります▼
そう！　あきらめなければ　かならず
ジムリーダーに　あえますから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>流れる　葉っぱ　はね
乗るときの　方向に　よって▽
行き先が　変わります▼
そう！　あきらめなければ　必ず
ジムリーダーに　会えますから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かっても……　まんがいち　まけても
その　りゆうを　ぶんせき　して▽
つよくなった　あたしに　かてますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝っても……　万が一　負けても
その理由を　分析して▽
強くなった　あたしに　勝てますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-17T07:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はいぼくの　りゆうを　かんがえたい……
そのため　ポケモンに　のりたいわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>敗北の　理由を　考えたい……
そのため　ポケモンに　乗りたいわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おきにいりの　ポケモンに　のりながら
かんがえごとを　すれば▽
いいかんじで　アイデアが　ひらめくの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>お気に入りの　ポケモンに　乗りながら
考え事を　すれば▽
いい感じで　アイデアが　ひらめくの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みず　ってのは　へんげんじざい……▼
いってんを　つらぬく　つよさ
ぶつりょうで　おしつぶす　パワー▽
それを　いまから　おみせするわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>水ってのは　変幻自在……▼
一点を　貫く　強さ
物量で　押しつぶす　パワー▽
それを　今から　おみせするわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんという　たくましさ……
シズイさんと　おなじ……　あるいは……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんという　たくましさ……
シズイさんと　同じ……　あるいは……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それぞれの　トレーナー
いろんな　ポケモンごとに　もつ▽
つよみは　ちがうのね▼
あたしは　もっともっと　じぶんの
ポケモンの　つよみを　しらないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それぞれの　トレーナー
いろんな　ポケモンごとに　持つ▽
強みは　ちがうのね▼
あたしは　もっともっと　自分の
ポケモンの　強みを　知らないとね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チッ！　もう　まけるのは
うんざり　なんだよ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チッ！　もう　負けるのは
うんざり　なんだよ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_02_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　うばった　ポケモン……
ちっとも　つかえねーな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　奪った　ポケモン……
ちっとも　使えねーな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_2_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あ……　そっかあ
いまの　かんがえてるよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あ……　そっかあ
今の　考えてるよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWBOSS_1_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よろしいっ！
なかなかの　ものです！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-15T05:47:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-15T05:47:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よろしいっ！
なかなかの　ものです！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-15T05:47:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-15T05:47:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そりゃ　かんちがい　するか
たしかに　なかなか　やりやがる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そりゃ　勘違い　するか
たしかに　なかなか　やるやがる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なあに？　この　うばった　ヤツ
ちっとも　つかえないのね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:35:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:35:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なあに？　この　奪った　ヤツ
ちっとも　使えねないのね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:35:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T04:35:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BCHAMP_1_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ブラボー！！▼
あなたさまに　みせていただいたのは
トレーナーとしての　きらめきです▼
ですが　ひとこと
いわせて　いただきましょう！▼
あなたさまがた　なら
もっともっと　うえを　めざせましょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ブラボー！！▼
あなたさまに　みせていただいたのは
トレーナーとしての　きらめきです▼
ですが　一言
いわせて　いただきましょう！▼
あなたさまがた　なら
もっともっと　上を　目指せましょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BCHAMP2_1_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼく　クダリ▼
ノボリと　いっしょに　まけちゃった▼
きみたちの　コンビネーション
さいこう　バツグン！▽
ものすごーく　つよい　トレーナー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼく　クダリ▼
ノボリと　一緒に　負けちゃった▼
きみたちの　コンビネーション
最高　バツグン！▽
ものすごーく　強い　トレーナー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T09:05:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_01_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは……　こいする　おとこ
そのなも　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは……　恋する　男
その名も　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BADRIDER_01_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは……　こいする　おとこ
そのなも　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは……　恋する　男
その名も　チャールズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWSAGE2_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほう！　ポケモンと　こころが
つうじているような　たたかいかた</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほう！　ポケモンと　心が
通じているような　戦い方</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おまえ……！　ポケモンを
しんじて　たたかう　トレーナーか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おまえ……！　ポケモンを
信じて　戦う　トレーナーか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
