		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おなじように　ボールを　さわるほどの
コンビネーション　だったのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>同じように　ボールを　触るほどの
コンビネーション　だったのに！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
