			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　選んだ　３匹……
お互いを　支えあっていたわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちかづく　あしおと……
きみが　くるのを　まっていた！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>近づく　足音……
君が　来るのを　待っていた！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あしおとで　わかっていたよ
きみが　つわもの　だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>足音で　わかっていたよ
君が　強者だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほんとうは　これを
あげる　つもりだったんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>本当は　これを
あげる　つもりだったんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おちばに　くるまれながら
ミノムッチという　ポケモンの▽
きもちを　そうぞう　していたんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>落ち葉に　くるまれながら
ミノムッチという　ポケモンの▽
気持ちを　想像していたんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>とびあがった　いきおいで
レディ……　ファイトォ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>飛びあがった　勢いで
レディ……　ファイトォ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんて　おちついているんだ！？
いきおいだけでは　かてなかった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんて　落ちついているんだ！？
勢いだけでは　勝てなかった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おちばの　なかで
はっけんした　きのみ　だよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>落ち葉の　中で
発見した　きのみ　だよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じめんに　もぐっている
ポケモンの　きもちを▽
あじわいたくて　うまっていたのさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>地面に　潜っている
ポケモンの　気持ちを▽
味わいたくて　埋まっていたのさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おどろいたでしょ！？
その　スキを　つくわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>驚いたでしょ！？
その　スキを　つくわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さすが！
どんなときでも　そなえているのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さすが！
どんなときでも　備えているのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そなえ　あれば　うれい　なし！
と　いうことで　これを！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>備えあれば　憂いなし！
と　いうことで　これを！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おちばの　したに　もぐっていたのは
しぜんと　ひとつに　なるためなの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>落ち葉の下に　潜っていたのは
自然と　一つに　なるためなの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まっかに　もえる
レンジャーだましい　みせてあげる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>真っ赤に　燃える
レンジャー魂　みせてあげる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたの　トレーナーたましい
まっかに　もえているね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたの　トレーナー魂
真っ赤に　燃えているね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたの　たましいに
これを　ささげるわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたの　魂に
これを　捧げるわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_18_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あかい　コスチュームと
おちばの　コーディネートなの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>赤い　コスチュームと
落ち葉の　コーディネートなの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T05:14:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おや！？　ここで　オレいがいの
ひとと　あうなんて　うれしいな！▼
ひさびさの　ポケモンしょうぶ
あいてを　してもらえない　ですかね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おや！？　ここで　オレ以外の
人と　会うなんて　うれしいな！▼
ひさびさの　ポケモン勝負
相手を　してもらえない　ですかね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やせいポケモンも　いいけど
トレーナーあいては　スリルが　あるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>野生ポケモンも　いいけど
トレーナー相手は　スリルが　あるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　いえ……
かぐが　かってに　うごいてません？▼
いえいえ　オレじゃあ　ないです！
オレは　うごかして　ないですよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この家え……
家具が　勝手に　動いてません？▼
いえいえ　オレじゃあ　ないです！
オレは　動かして　ないですよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなた……　ダレ？▼
ここに　あたしいがいの　にんげんが！
トレーナーが　いるなんて　おかしい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなた……　ダレ？▼
ここに　あたし以外の　人間が！
トレーナーが　いるなんて　おかしい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたは　ふつうの　にんげん
ふつうの　ポケモントレーナー　ね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたは　普通の　人間
普通の　ポケモントレーナー　ね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　いえ　には……
おそれ　かなしみ　あきらめ……▼
さまざまな　おもいが　うずまき……
みちの　エネルギーと　なっている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　家には……
恐れ　哀しみ　あきらめ……▼
様々な　思いが　うずまき……
未知の　エネルギーと　なっている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たぎる　たましい！
オレの ミネズミ　すっげーぜ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たぎる　魂！
オレの　ミネズミ　すっげーぜ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しぼむ　たましい……
こんなはずじゃ　なかったのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>しぼむ　魂……
こんなはずじゃ　なかったのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふたたび　たぎる　たましい！
まけたって　きにしない！▽
まえに　すすむことが　だいじだぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>再び　たぎる　魂！
負けたって　気にしない！▽
前に　進むことが　大事だぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T06:10:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLB_13_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トリプルバトルは　ポケモン
３びきでの　ポケモンしょうぶ　だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３匹での　ポケモン勝負だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLB_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トリプルバトルを　きわめた
ぼくの　つよさを　みなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トリプルバトルを　極めた
ぼくの　強さを　みなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLB_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんな……
きわめたはず　なのに……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんな……
極めたはず　なのに……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLB_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きわめるために　トリプルバトルむきの
わざとか　とくせいを　しらべなきゃ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>極めるために　トリプルバトル向きの
技とか　特性を　調べなきゃ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLG_11_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションは　ポケモン
３びきで　たたかう　しょうぶ　です！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３匹で　戦う　勝負です！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLG_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションバトル！
みぎにまわす？　ひだりにまわす？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトル！
右にまわす？　左にまわす？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLG_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どちらに　まわすか　まようのは
けいけんが　たりないからなの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どちらに　まわすか　迷うのは
経験が　足りないからなの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCHOOLG_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たりない　けいけんは
ちしき　かんがえで　おぎないます▼
でないと　せんぱいトレーナーに
いつまでも　かてないもの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たりない　経験は
知識　考えで　補います▼
でないと　先輩トレーナーに
いつまでも　勝てないものね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T12:22:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こどもと　ポケモンたち
たくさんの　えがおに　かこまれて▽
むてきの　アタシ　でーす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>子供と　ポケモンたち
たくさんの　笑顔に　囲まれて▽
無敵の　アタシ　でーす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うわあ！　すごいすごい！
アナタ　とっても　つよいのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うわあ！　すごいすごい！
アナタ　とっても　強いのね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいての　めを　みて　はなす
そうして　きもちを　つたえあう……▽
ひとも　ポケモンも　おなじだよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>相手の　目を見て　話す
そうして　気持ちを　伝えあう……▽
人も　ポケモンも　同じだよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
