		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_34_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マグマは　なぜ　あついか！
キミに　こたえられるかな！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マグマは　なぜ　熱いか！
キミに　答えられるかな！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_34_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その　きはく！　あつりょく！
それこそが　こたえ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その　気迫！　圧力！
それこそが　答え！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_34_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちかふかくの　つよい　あつりょくが
いわを　とかし　マグマに　かえるんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>地下深くの　強い　圧力が
岩を　溶かし　マグマに　変えるんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いわに　かこまれていると
テンション　あがっちゃう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>岩に　囲まれていると
テンション　あがっちゃう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけると
テンション　さがっちゃう……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けると
テンション　さがっちゃう……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>テンション　あがったり　さがったり
にぎやかなのが　オレの　いいところ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>テンション　あがったり　さがったり
にぎやかなのが　オレの　いいところ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わがはいは　なぜ　あなをほるのか？
おぬしは　なぜ　たたかうのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>我輩は　なぜ　穴を掘るのか？
おぬしは　なぜ　戦うのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おぬしの　いままでの　けいけん……
それが　つよさの　みなもとか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おぬしの　今までの　経験……
それが　強さの　源か！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかっただけ　つよくなる
ほっただけ　あなが　ひろがる……▽
もくてきがあれば　ムダなんて　ない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦っただけ　強くなる
掘っただけ　穴が　広がる……▽
目的があれば　無駄なんて　ない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_36_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>パトロールを　していたら
つよそうな　トレーナー　はっけん！▽
いくぞ！　シンボラー！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>パトロールを　していたら
強そうな　トレーナー　発見！▽
いくぞ！　シンボラー！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_36_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オラが　かんじたとおり
オニつよい　トレーナーだった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オラが　感じたとおり
オニ強い　トレーナーだった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_36_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オラの　シンボラー　だけどよ▼
いつも　おんなじ　ルートを
とおりたがるんだけど　なんでだ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オラの　シンボラー　だけどよ▼
いつも　おんなじ　ルートを
通りたがるんだけど　なんでだ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_39_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いつも　ちからしごとの　おれたちの
パワフルこうげき　うけてみろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いつも　力仕事の　おれたちの
パワフル攻撃　受けてみろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_39_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちからしごとで　きたえた　おれたち
まけるときも　パワフル　だぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>力仕事で　鍛えた　おれたち！
負けるときも　パワフル　だぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_39_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　イワオ！　すきな　ポケモンと
ともに　はたらけて　しあわせなんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　イワオ！　すきな　ポケモンと
ともに　働けて　シアワセなんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_40_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやまは　きせつで　かわり
おっさんは　しょうぶで　かわる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山は　季節で　変わり
おっさんは　勝負で　変わる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_40_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……おとな　あいてに
てかげん　してくれよな！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……大人相手に
手加減して　くれよな！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER2_40_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっさん　ふゆが　すきなんだ▼
ネジやまに　つもる　ゆき……
なんとも　いえない　けしき　なんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっさん　冬が　好きなんだ▼
ネジ山に　積もる　雪……
なんとも　いえない　景色なんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>クールな　こおりポケモンと
あつい　オレの　コンビネーション！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>クールな　こおりポケモンと
熱い　オレの　コンビネーション！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたらも　クール＆ホットな
コンビの　ようだな……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたらも　クール＆ホットな
コンビの　ようだな……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやまは　いちねんじゅう　さむい！▼
まふゆでも　げんきな
こおりポケモンが　だいかつやく　よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山は　一年中　寒い！▼
真冬でも　元気な
こおりポケモンが　大活躍よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヘイ　わかもの！
おじさんが　あたためて　あげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヘイ　若者！
おじさんが　暖めて　あげよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハァッ……！　しょうぶを　すると
アセを　かくほど　あたたまるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハァッ……！　勝負を　すると
アセを　かくほど　あたたまるね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さわって　たしかめても　いいよ？
ほら　アセで　ぐっしょり……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>触って　確かめても　いいよ？
ほら　アセで　ぐっしょり……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エスパーポケモンに
しごとを　おまかせ　すれば▼
ちからしごとも　ラクチン！
アタクシ　サボれるって　きづいたの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エスパーポケモンに
仕事を　お任せ　すれば▼
力仕事も　ラクチン！
アタクシ　サボれるって　気づいたの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そっか！　トレーナーが　サボったら
ポケモン　こまっちゃうよな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そっか！　トレーナーが　サボったら
ポケモン　困っちゃうよな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WORKER1_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　いっしょに
しごとを　するのが　さぎょういん▼
ポケモンに　まかせきりで
サボっていては　ダメなのです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　一緒に
仕事を　するのが　さぎょういん▼
ポケモンに　任せきりで
サボっていては　ダメなのです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやまに　こもって
はや　２ねん……▼
しゅぎょうの　せいかを
いま　ためさせて　いただこう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山に　こもって
早　２年……▼
修行の　成果を
今　試させて　いただこう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じゅくれん　したものが
かならず　かつとも　かぎらない……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>熟練したものが
必ず　勝つとも　限らない……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_15_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひたすら　しゅぎょうに　あけくれる
わたしのような　ものも　いれば▼
たびを　つうじて　せいちょうする
きみのような　ものもいる……　か</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひたすら　修行に　明け暮れる
私のような　者も　いれば▼
旅を　通じて　成長する
君のような　者もいる……　か</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_16_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トリプルバトルは　ポケモン
３びきでの　あたらしい　しょうぶだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トリプルバトルは　ポケモン
３匹での　新しい　勝負だ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よし！　ひごろの　せいか
すべて　みせてやる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よし！　日ごろの　成果
すべて　みせてやる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひごろの　せいか……
みせられなかった▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>日ごろの　成果……
みせられなかった▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　バランスを　かんがえて
もっと　ちゃんと　そだてるぞ！▼
むはは！　いくつに　なっても
チャレンジこそが　いきがい　よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　バランスを　考えて
もっと　ちゃんと　育てるぞ！▼
むはは！　いくつに　なっても
チャレンジこそが　生きがい　よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやま　ナンバーワンの
せんりゃくか！　それが　あたしさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山　ナンバーワンの
戦略家！　それが　あたしさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやま　ナンバーワンで
まんぞく　しちゃってた……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山　ナンバーワンで
満足　しちゃってた……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ありがとう……
おかげで　めが　さめたわ▼
ネジやまでの　ナンバーワンは
あたしにとって　つうかてん　だったわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ありがとう……
おかげで　目が　覚めたわ▼
ネジ山での　ナンバーワンは
あたしにとって　通過点だったわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_13_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３びきでの　ポケモンしょうぶ　だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３匹での　ポケモン勝負だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルでは
まわさない！　ってのも　だいじだね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルでは
まわさない！　ってのも　大事だね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２ねんかん　ローテーションバトルの
しゅぎょうを　したけど　まだまだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２年間　ローテーションバトルの
修行を　したけど　まだまだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ギャンブラーの　ギーマなら
どちらにまわすか　はずさないだろうね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ギャンブラーの　ギーマなら
どちらにまわすか　はずさないだろうね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちていに　ひろがる　みずうみ
ほとりに　たたずむ　やまおとこ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>地底に　広がる　湖
ほとりに　たたずむ　やまおとこ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あざやかに　しょうりする
わかき　トレーナー……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>鮮やかに　勝利する
若き　トレーナー……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちかすいが　たまって　できた
みずうみ……▼
にごりの　ない
すみわたる　あおさ　だよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>地下水が　たまって　できた
地底湖……▼
にごりの　ない
すみわたる　青さ　だよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっとちょっと！　この　ぬけみち
おおむかしに　つくられた　らしいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっとちょっと！　この　抜け道
大昔に　つくられた　らしいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>す　すまない……
つい　こうふん　して……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>す　すまない……
つい　興奮して……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおむかしの　ひとたちが　これだけ
ながい　トンネルを　ほったのか▼
やはり　たくさんの　ポケモンと
ちからを　あわせて　ほったんだろうな▼
……いや　もしかしたら
こきつかわれていたのかも　しれないぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大昔の　人たちが　これだけ
長い　トンネルを　掘ったのか▼
やはり　たくさんの　ポケモンと
協力して　掘ったんだろうな▼
……いや　もしかしたら
こき使われていたのかも　しれないぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ブラリ　ブラブラ　さんぽみち
ちぢめて　ブラさんぽ▼
きょうは　どんな　ポケモンと
であえますかねえ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ブラリ　ブラブラ　散歩道
ちぢめて　ブラ散歩▼
きょうは　どんな　ポケモンと
であえますかねえ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いい　とくせいの
ポケモン　ですねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いい　特性の
ポケモン　ですねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>テレビばんぐみの　ブラさんぽ
すきだったのに　おわっちゃったんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>テレビ番組の　ブラ散歩
好きだったのに　終わっちゃったんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まずは　おおきく……▼
いきを　しない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まずは　大きく……▼
息を　しない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぷはああああ！！
……いき　とめてると　しんどいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぷはああああ！！
……息　止めてると　しんどいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T13:26:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　すった　ここの　くうき……▼
もしかしたら　おおむかしの
くうき　そのまま　かもしれないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今　吸った　ここの　空気……▼
もしかしたら　大昔の　空気
そのまま　かもしれないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やっほー！
やーっほおぉーうっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やっほー！
やーっほおぉーうっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まぁーけぇーたぁーっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負ぁーけぇーたぁーっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やーっほおぉーうっ！▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ぬけみちは　こえが　ひびくね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やーっほおぉーうっ！▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
抜け道は　声が　響くね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　たびの　みちのりと
あなたの　たびの　みちのりが▽
いま　ここで　クロスする……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T07:12:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>私の　旅の　道のりと
あなたの　旅の　道のりが▽
今　ここで　交差する……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おもえば　とおくへ　きたものね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>思えば　遠くへ　来たものね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BACKPACKERW_21_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たびさきなら　みしらぬ　ひととも
どうどうと　しょうぶ　できちゃう……▼
なんだか　だいたんに　なれちゃうの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>旅先なら　見知らぬ　人とも
堂々と　勝負できちゃう……▼
なんだか　大胆に　なれちゃうの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここにいる　ということは
きみも　げすいどうの　いちぶ！？▽
よろしい！　ちょうさ　だ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここにいる　ということは
きみも　下水道の　一部！？▽
よろしい！　調査だ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えっ？　ここは　どこ？
きみは　だれ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えっ？　ここは　どこ？
きみは　だれ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はっ！　わたしは　げすいどうの
ちょうさに　むちゅうに　なりすぎて▽
こだいのぬけみちに　いたのか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はっ！　わたしは　下水道の
調査に　夢中に　なりすぎて▽
古代の抜け道に　いたのか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>げすいどうと　こだいのぬけみち……▼
ちかくに　そんざい　するのは
たんに　ぐうぜんの　いっち　かな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>下水道と　古代の抜け道……▼
近くに　存在するのは
単に　偶然の　一致かな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいえ！　きっと　りゆうが……
あっ！　いつのまにか　まけてる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいえ！　きっと　理由が……
あっ！　いつの間にか　負けてる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>げんだいじんは　げすいどうを　つくり
こだいじんは　ぬけみちを　つくる……▼
いまも　むかしも　あなをほるのが
たまらなく　すきな　ひとが　いるの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>現代人は　下水道を　つくり
古代人は　抜け道を　つくる……▼
今も　昔も　あなをほるのが
たまらなく　好きな　人が　いるの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPM_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いせきの　パワーを　かりて　ぼくの
サイコパワーを　パワーアップ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>遺跡の　パワーを　借りて　ぼくの
サイコパワーを　パワーアップ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPM_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンまで　つよくなる
そういう　わけでは　なかったか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンまで　強くなる
そういう　わけでは　なかったか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPM_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かりもので　つよくなって　いいのは
レンタルポケモン！▼
はっ！　いま
ぼくは　なにを　くちばしったんだ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>借りもので　強くなって　いいのは
レンタルポケモン！▼
はっ！　いま
ぼくは　なにを　口走ったんだ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きてる……　きてるわ！
こだいの　スピリチュアル　パワー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>来てる……　来てるわ！
古代の　スピリチュアル　パワー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こだいの　パワー！
スピリチュアル　パワー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>古代の　パワー！
スピリチュアル　パワー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ただならぬ　パワーを
この　おくで　かんじるのです！▼
そう！　たいようの　ような
あつく　かがやく　パワー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ただならぬ　パワーを
この　奥で　感じるのです！▼
そう！　太陽の　ような
熱く　輝く　パワー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T13:25:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_02_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それじゃ　クールで　キュートな
メンバーを　しょうかい　するね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それじゃ　クールで　キュートな
メンバーを　紹介するね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_02_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>メンバー　ぼしゅう　しないと
サウンドの　あつみが　たりないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メンバー　募集しないと
サウンドの　厚みが　たりないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_02_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなた　ふしぎな　ひとだね！▼
まけたけど　たのしかったのかな？
アタシの　ポケモン　わらってるし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなた　不思議な　人だね！▼
負けたけど　楽しかったのかな？
アタシの　ポケモン　笑ってるし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T05:55:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いきます！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いきます！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　スタイル
でんき　はしってる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　スタイル
電気　走ってる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_GUITARW_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あのね　さいしょは　ポケモンの
せいかつを　ジャマしないように▽
ひっそり　れんしゅう　してたの▼
でもね　さいきんは　ポケモンが
あつまって　きいてくれるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あのね　最初は　ポケモンの
生活を　ジャマしないように▽
ひっそり　練習してたの▼
でもね　最近は　ポケモンが
集まって　聴いてくれるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほらあなを　さまよう　やまおとこが
じんせいの　きびしさ▽
ポケモンしょうぶの　むずかしさを▽
とことん　おしえてやろう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>洞穴を　さまよう　やまおとこが
人生の　厳しさ▽
ポケモン勝負の　難しさを▽
とことん　教えてやろう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おしえられた……
おまえは　きびしい　やつだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>教えられた……
おまえは　厳しい　やつだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-25T12:59:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほらあなの　なか……
じめんが　もりあがった　ところには▽
ポケモンが　いるんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>洞穴の　中……
地面が　盛りあがった　ところには▽
ポケモンが　いるんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やまの　あいさつ
ほらあなの　あいさつ▼
そら！　おたがいの　ポケモンを
だして　はじめようぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>山の　あいさつ
洞穴の　あいさつ▼
そら！　お互いの　ポケモンを
だして　はじめようぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さよなら……
さよなら……　わしの　ビクトリー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さよなら……
さよなら……　わしの　ビクトリー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおむかしは　ポケモンと　ひとが
くらす　ばしょは　べつべつだった▼
それが　こうして　いりまじって……▼
いいことか　どうか　わからんが
いろいろ　かわっていくのだろうな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大昔は　ポケモンと　人が
暮らす　場所は　別々だった▼
それが　こうして　入り混じって……▼
いいことか　どうか　わからんが
いろいろ　変わっていくのだろうな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほらあなの　あちこちに　ある
でんきを　はっしている　いわ！▽
その　でんきで　げんきいっぱい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>洞穴の　あちこちに　ある
電気を　発している　岩！▽
その電気で　元気一杯！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エレキテル！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エレキテル！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTM_16_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　エネルギーの　みなもとは
いとしの　ポケモンたちです！▽
これは　かがくてきに　しょうめいずみ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしの　エネルギー源は
愛しの　ポケモンたちです！▽
これは　科学的に　証明済み！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でんきで　ひらめきを　しげきする
この　ばしょが　だいすき　なんです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電気で　ひらめきを　刺激する
この場所が　大好き　なんです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ピコーン！
いまので　ひらめきました！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ピこーン！
いまので　ひらめきました！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-16T10:45:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SCIENTISTW_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>からだが　うごくとき
でんきの　しんごうが　ながれます！▼
ひらめくときも　あたまに
でんきの　しんごうが　ながれるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>体が　動くとき
電気の　信号が　流れます！▼
ひらめくときも　頭に
電気信号が　流れるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でんきの　ちからを
とりこもうと　ここに　やってきた▽
ポケモンレンジャーが　おれだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電気の　力を
取り込もうと　ここに　やってきた▽
ポケモンレンジャーが　おれだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むう！　おれは　まだ
でんきを　だせないのか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>むう！　おれは　まだ
でんきを　だせないのか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これでも▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これでも▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンが　でんきを　だすのは
ズルイ　というか　カッコいいよな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンが　電気を　だすのは
ズルイ　というか　カッコいいよな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたが　くることは
かぜが　ささやいてくれたわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたが　来ることは
風が　ささやいてくれたわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
