			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FUTAGO_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダブル！　ダブル！
……ダブルって　なに？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダブル！　ダブル！
……ダブルって　なに？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FUTAGO_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むずかしいことは
まだ　わかんないけど▼
ポケモンは　かわいくて
しょうぶは　たのしいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>むずかしいことは
まだ　わかんないけど▼
ポケモンは　かわいくて
しょうぶは　たのしいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FUTAGO_08_TRMSG_POKE_ONE_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おとーさんと　おかーさん　いってた
ふこうへいは　いけないって▼
だからね　ダブルバトルは
ポケモン　２ひき　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おとーさんと　おかーさん　いってた
ふこうへいは　いけないって▼
だからね　ダブルバトルは
ポケモン　２ひき　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_29_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレの　ポケモン
ジットリ　しめって　いくぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレの　ポケモン
ジットリ　湿っていくぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_29_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うるおいでは　まけてない……
そう　しんじることに　するぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うるおいでは　負けてない……
そう　信じることに　するぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T03:39:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_29_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジメジメしてるのが　いいんだ
みんな　あかるく　とか　おかしいだろ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジメジメしてるのが　いいんだ
みんな　明るく　とか　おかしいだろ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MINI_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それ　ポケモンずかん！？▼
じゃあ　いろんな　ポケモンを
みせてくれると　うれしいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それ　ポケモン図鑑！？▼
じゃあ　いろんな　ポケモンを
みせてくれると　うれしいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MINI_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……！
そんな　ポケモン　しらない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……！
そんな　ポケモン　知らない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MINI_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むう……　しつげんに　いけば
あたらしい　ポケモンと　であえるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>むう……　湿原に　行けば
新しい　ポケモンと　出会えるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_12_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トリプルバトルは　ポケモン
３びきでの　あたらしい　しょうぶよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トリプルバトルは　ポケモン
３匹での　新しい　勝負よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チャップ　チャップって　おと！
あなたの　あしおと　だったのね▽
もう　あいくるしいわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チャップ　チャップって　音！
あなたの　足音だったのね▽
もう　愛くるしいわね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんなに　つよすぎると
かわいくないわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんなに　強すぎると
かわいくないわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_12_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あしおと　うらないに　よると……▼
チャップ　チャップな　あなたは
ポケモンに　すかれる　トレーナーさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>足音占いに　よると……▼
チャップ　チャップな　あなたは
ポケモンに　好かれる　トレーナーさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_13_TRMSG_POKE_UNDER_TWO"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３びきでの　ポケモンしょうぶ　よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ローテーションバトルは　ポケモン
３匹での　ポケモン勝負よ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>パラソルを　くるりと　まわせば
あめの　なか　さいた　はなのよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>パラソルを　くるりと　回せば
雨の中　咲いた　花のよう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えい！　パラソルを　まわして
すいてき　とばしてあげる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えい！　パラソルを　まわして
水滴　飛ばしてあげる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T06:40:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_PARASOL_13_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あめのひに　かさをさすのも
コートをきるのも　ぬれちゃうのも▽
すきなように　すれば　いいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>雨の日に　傘をさすのも
コートを着るのも　ぬれちゃうのも▽
好きなように　すれば　いいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほんものの　つりびとは
きが　みじかい！　しょうぶ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>本物の　つりびとは
気が　短い！　勝負！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T03:54:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけた！
おわり！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けた！
終わり！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なぜ　ほんものの　つりびとは
きが　みじかいか？▼
それは　ポケモンが　つれないと
ムキになって　ばしょを　かえるからだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なぜ　本物の　つりびとは
気が　短いか？▼
それは　ポケモンが　釣れないと
ムキになって　場所を　変えるからだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんをしり　あいてをしり
まわりを　しるのが　レンジャーさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分を知り　相手を知り
周りを　知るのが　レンジャーさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいてを　しるって
むずかしいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>相手を　知るって
難しいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こいつの　ことは
知ってるかい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こいつの　ことは
しってるかい？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　やせいポケモンが
せいそく　しているのか　わかれば▼
あいしょうの　いい
ポケモンを　つれて　あるけるだろ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　野生ポケモンが
生息しているのか　わかれば▼
相性の　いい
ポケモンを　連れて　歩けるだろ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T03:31:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモントレーナーは　しょうぶで
ゆうじょうを　はぐくむもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモントレーナーは　勝負で
友情を　育むもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　まけた　きもち……
まるで　そこなしぬま……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　負けた　気持ち……
まるで　底なし沼……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　ラムのみは　あなたとの
ゆうじょうの　あかし　よ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　ラムのみは
あなたとの　友情の　証よ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じっと　みみを　すませて
ポケモンの　なきごえや　あしおと……
きぎや　ぬまの　こきゅうを　きくのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>じっと　耳を　すませて
ポケモンの　鳴き声や　足音……▽
木々や　沼の　呼吸を　きくのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トレーナーが　いれば
とにかく　しょうぶを　する！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トレーナーが　いれば
とにかく　勝負を　する！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんな　つよい　トレーナー
みたことがない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんな　つよい　トレーナー
みたことがない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だれとでも　しょうぶ　するよ▼
だって　ぼくが　みたことのない
みずタイプの　ポケモンを▽
みせてくれるかも　しれないからね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だれとでも　勝負するよ▼
だって　ぼくが　みたことのない
みずタイプの　ポケモンを▽
みせてくれるかも　しれないからね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T09:36:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あとすこし……
きっかけが　ほしい！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あと少し……
きっかけが　ほしい！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_FISHING_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……できた！
にゅうこんの　はいく！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T09:51:00" />
