				Time="2012-01-12T09:22:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こいつめ！　おれの
道具を　壊しやがって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T09:22:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
