		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWPLAZMAM_33_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけても　プラズマだんの
せいぎを　つらぬく！　それだけだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T09:22:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T09:22:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けても　プラズマ団の
正義を　貫く！　それだけだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T09:22:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
