		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DOCTOR_10_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ドクターとして　あなたの
ポケモンの　つよさを　みます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ドクターとして　あなたの
ポケモンの　強さを　みます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T05:49:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
