		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEM_43_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さいきん　かんがえるんだ▼
こいつらと　はなればなれに　なったら
また　オレを　トレーナーとして▽
えらんでもらえるのかな……　って</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さいきん　かんがえるんだ▼
こいつらと　はなればなれに　なったら
また　オレを　トレーナーとして▽
えらんでもらえるのかな……　って</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_42_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら！　あたしの　ポケモン
きょうは　すごく　やるきね！▼
というわけで　おあいて　よろしく！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら！　あたしの　ポケモン
今日は　すごく　やる気ね！▼
というわけで　お相手　よろしく！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_42_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモンの　ほうが
すごい　やるき　だったみたいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモンの　ほうが
すごい　やる気　だったみたいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_42_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンだって　いきてるもの
やるきの　ないときも　あるでしょ▽
そんなときは　ノンビリしちゃうの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンだって　生きてるもの
やる気の　ないときも　あるでしょ▽
そんなときは　ノンビリしちゃうの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きたえに　きたえた　オレさまと
さらに　きたえた　ポケモンだ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>鍛えに　鍛えた　オレ様と
さらに　鍛えた　ポケモンだ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そりゃそりゃそりゃあ！
まけたが　げんきのいい　オレさまだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そりゃそりゃそりゃあ！
負けたが　元気のいい　オレ様だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレさまの　かくとうポケモン！
ためしのいわを　わって　きたえている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレ様の　かくとうポケモン！
試しの岩を　割って　鍛えている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　いっしょに
ためしのいわに　こぶしを　つきだす！▼
じみちな　すこしずつの
つみかさねが　いちばん　なの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　一緒に
試しの岩に　こぶしを　つきだす！▼
地道な　少しずつの
積み重ねが　一番なの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まだまだ
つみかさなってない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まだまだ
積み重なってない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_22_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　いっしょに
ためしのいわに　こぶしを　つきだす！▼
あなたも　かくとうタイプの　ポケモンと
ためしのいわを　しらべたら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　一緒に
試しの岩に　こぶしを　つきだす！▼
あなたも　かくとうタイプの　ポケモンと
試しの岩を　調べたら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤグルマのもりを　すみから　すみまで
パトロールしている　この　オレ！▽
ここでの　しょうぶは　おてのもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤグルマの森を　隅から　隅まで
パトロールしている　この　オレ！▽
ここでの　勝負は　おてのもの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……ヤグルマのもりで
まけるとは　ふかく　だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……ヤグルマの森で
負けるとは　不覚　だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンジャーが　つねに　もっている
これを　きみに……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンジャーが　常に　持っている
これを　きみに……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もりは　いきている……▼
まいにち　なにかしら　へんかして
パトロールも　たのしいんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>森は　生きている……▼
毎日　なにかしら　変化して
パトロールも　楽しいんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やせいに　とけこむ！
それが　ポケモンレンジャーだ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>野生に　とけこむ！
それが　ポケモンレンジャーだ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんじゃくものの　オレめ！
もういちど　やせいに　とけこもう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>軟弱者の　オレめ！
もう一度　野生に　とけこもう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみなら　これを
つかいこなせるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみなら　これを
使いこなせるだろう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERM_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やせいに　とけこみすぎると
ひとは　もちろん▽
ポケモンにも　きづいてもらえないのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>野生に　とけこみすぎると
人は　もちろん▽
ポケモンにも　気づいてもらえないのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スー　ハー
ヒー　フー▼
はい！　しんこきゅうの　つぎは
ポケモンを　たたかわせましょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スー　ハー
ヒー　フー▼
はい！　深呼吸の　次は
ポケモンを　戦わせましょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かなしくて　でるのは
ためいき　ばかりね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>悲しくて　でるのは
ため息　ばかりね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしからは　ほかにも
こんな　モノが　でてきます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしからは　他にも
こんな　モノが　でてきます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T08:01:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_27_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　ばしょに
いろんな　ポケモンが　いる……▼
いろんな　みんなに　ぴったりの
いばしょが　あるって　ことかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いろんな　場所に
いろんな　ポケモンが　いる……▼
いろんな　みんなに　ぴったりの
居場所が　あるって　ことかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいしぜんに　さからわず……
おおいなる　ちからを　える▽
それが　レンジャーの　つよさなの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大自然に　逆らわず……
おおいなる　力を　得る▽
それが　レンジャーの　強さなの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおいなる　ちから！
あなたの　ポケモン　マーベラス！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おおいなる　ちから！
あなたの　ポケモン　マーベラス！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_BEFORE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これも　だいしぜん　から
えた　ちからの　１つよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これも　大自然から
得た　力の　１つよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RANGERW_28_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_GIFTITEM_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンって　すごすぎるでしょ
つい　たよりすぎちゃうのよね▽
おおいなる　ちからって　あぶないわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンって　すごすぎるでしょ
つい　頼りすぎちゃうのよね▽
おおいなる　力って　危ないわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T07:31:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんとなく　なつかしくてね
ここに　あしを　はこんだが……▼
かこを　ふりかえるよりも
いま　きみと　たたかいたいね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんとなく　懐かしくてね
ここに　足を　運んだが……▼
過去を　振り返るよりも
いま　きみと　戦いたいね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうか　そうだったな
わたしも　むかしは　ひっしだった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうか　そうだったな
わたしも　昔は　必死だった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こどもの　ころを　おもいだすよ
むじゃきに　むしポケモンを　おいかけ▼
ポケモントレーナーとしての　スタートは
あのひ　このばしょ　だったんだな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こどもの　ころを　思いだすよ
無邪気に　むしポケモンを　追いかけ▼
ポケモントレーナーとしての　スタートは
あの日　この場所　だったんだな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしが　うんめいの　であいをした
ポケモンたちを　おひろめ　するよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしが　運命の　であいをした
ポケモンたちを　お披露目するよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたが　であった　ポケモン
かなり　たくましい　じゃないか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたが　であった　ポケモン
かなり　たくましい　じゃないか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANW_17_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかい　こどもたちは　いいね
いろんな　ポケモンと　であえてさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>若い　こどもたちは　いいね
いろんな　ポケモンと　であえてさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_31_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たんパンと　ポケモンの　くみあわせ
これって　さいきょう　だよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たんパンと　ポケモンの　組み合わせ
これって　最強だよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_31_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンは　わるくない！
たんパンも　わるくない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　悪くない！
たんパンも　悪くない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_31_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひざこぞうを　きたえるため
たんパン　なんだ！　さわってみる？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひざこぞうを　鍛えるため
たんパン　なんだ！　さわってみる？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_32_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくの　ポケモンの　すごいところ！
たたかえば　わかるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくの　ポケモンの　すごいところ！
戦えば　わかるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_32_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おいおい！　ぼくの　ポケモンの
すごいところ　わかってくれた！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おいおい！　ぼくの　ポケモンの
すごいところ　わかってくれた！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_TANPAN_32_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくの　ポケモンの　すごいところ！▼
うーん……▼
たくさん　あって　わかんないや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくの　ポケモンの　すごいところ！▼
うーん……▼
たくさん　あって　わかんないや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたは……　おとなのような
こどものような……　ええい！▽
しょうぶして　さぐっちゃう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたは……　大人のような
こどものような……　ええい！▽
勝負して　探っちゃう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こどものような　おとなのような
ふしぎな　トレーナーさんね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こどものような　大人のような
不思議な　トレーナーさんね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T14:08:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_09_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おとなびた　こども……
こどもっぽい　おとな……▼
どっちの　あいても　たいへん！
でも　どっちも　かわいいの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大人びた　こども……
こどもっぽい　大人……▼
どっちの　相手も　大変！
でも　どっちも　可愛いの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-22T06:11:05" />
