		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_MOUNT_29_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まわりが　いわだと　ワシだけでなく
ポケモンが　ウキウキするんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>周りが　岩だと　ワシだけでなく
ポケモンが　ウキウキするんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-21T06:57:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっ！　トレーナーさん！
トレーニングは　いかが？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっ！　トレーナーさん！
トレーニングは　いかが？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トレーニング　しゅうりょう！
ちょっと　プラスできたかも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トレーニング　終了！
ちょっと　プラスできたかも</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_23_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっとずつで　いいの！▼
わたし　ふつうの　ひと　だもん
いきなり　すごくなれないもんね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっとずつで　いいの！▼
わたし　普通の　人だもん
いきなり　すごくなれないもんね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-24T03:23:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……こんなところで　おちこんでいる
わたしだけど　いいかしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……こんな所で　落ちこんでいる
わたしだけど　いいかしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あの　ひとも
あなたぐらい　つよければ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あの　人も
あなたぐらい　強ければ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BATTLEG_24_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すきな　ひとが　いて
いいところを　みせようとしてね▼
すきな　ひとの　ポケモン
ボコボコに　しちゃったの……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>好きな　人が　いて
いいところを　みせようとしてね▼
好きな　人の　ポケモン
ボコボコに　しちゃったの……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:00:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にがてな　ポケモンを
こくふくした　わしである！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>苦手な　ポケモンを
克服した　わしである！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふむう！　きみは　ポケモンが
だいすきで　だいすき　なんだな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふむう！　きみは　ポケモンが
大好きで　大好き　なんだな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_25_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンが　にがてな　ひともいる
そういうことは　わすれがち　だけどな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンが　苦手な　人もいる
そういうことは　忘れがち　だけどな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あと　３にん！▼
あと　３にんに　かたないかぎり
おれは　ここを　でない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あと　３人！▼
あと　３人に　勝たないかぎり
おれは　ここを　でない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わーお！
きみの　ポケモン　すげー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わーお！
きみの　ポケモン　すげー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_KARATE_26_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えへへ！
あいてに　かつのも　つよさなら▼
じぶんで　きめたことを
やりとおすのも　つよさ　だな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えへへ！
相手に　勝つのも　強さなら▼
自分で　決めたことを
やりとおすのも　強さだな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おなじ　ひに　このよに　うまれ
ともに　そだった　ポケモンだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>同じ日に　この世に生まれ
共に育った　ポケモンだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おう！
やるじゃねーか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おう！
やるじゃねーか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_VETERANM_03_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　オレらの　まいにちは
これまでも　しあわせに　あふれ▽
これからも　よろこびに　みちている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　オレらの　毎日は
これまでも　幸せに　あふれ▽
これからも　喜びに　満ちている！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_NINJA_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……だから　どうした</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……だから　どうした</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-14T02:39:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_NINJA_06_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょせん　かげ　か……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-26T09:18:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
