	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWRIVAL_19_TRMSG_FIGHT_FIRST_DAMAGE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オマエの　あいては
いつも　きもちが　たかぶるぜッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T05:59:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オマエの　相手は
いつも　気持ちが　たかぶるぜッ！！</Text>
