	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_NURSE_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_RECOVER_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　ポケモンへの　あいは
いくどでも　げんきに　してあげること</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-28T08:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-28T08:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしの　ポケモンへの　愛は
いくどでも　元気に　してあげること</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-28T08:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-28T08:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_HEADS_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そとの　やつって……
こんなにも　すげえのか！</Text>
