	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ELITEW_50_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしにとって　ポケモンは
たいせつな　たいせつな　きょうだい▼
だって　うまれたときから
いっしょに　ないて　わらってきたもの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしにとって　ポケモンは
大切な　大切な　兄弟▼
だって　生まれたときから
一緒に　泣いて　笑ってきたもの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_START">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こころの　さけび！▼
みんな　ゆうこと　きけえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>心の　叫び！▼
みんな　ゆうこと　きけえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_CHILDCARE_11_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はあ　はあ　はあ
ちょっと　スッキリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:41:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はあ　はあ　はあ
